    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{2\\sqrt{7}}{21}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{3\\sqrt{7}}&=\\frac{2}{3\\sqrt{7}}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{7}}\\\\\\frac{2}{3\\sqrt{7}}&=\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{3\\times7}\\\\\\frac{2}{3\\sqrt{7}}&=\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{21}\\end{align*}$$",
